    "body": "The previous native Context probe selected inherited category credit and plateaued. This adds a Rust saved-artifact analysis that separates total ON, OFF and newly added temporal transition credit, then reconstructs exact native action margins at retained inputs. It reuses the existing gradients and frozen18-frame objective.\n\nAll17,472 fractional basis masters are authenticated; analysis covers7,680 self/neighbor transition coordinates in both declared directions. The strongest totalON move1660 has temporal opposition and no local row245 effect. Coordinate3610 has both totalON and temporal descent credit, but its local margins are not measured. The strongest difference-only52 move has totalON ascent. Top20 totalON margin candidates produce157 hypothetical fixed-input action changes across3,620 cases; these are local operator score diagnostics, with no changed recurrent trajectory or model qualification.\n\nExecuted sourcea1b77d7c6a8f6c0a5f1bf875efca5a8f6c2c7998 and binarye065356b7ea36ec098928b893a86fbc72a0587f8b07a86df26bd7d62bf1b2937: four focused tests, format/releaseCUDA build and exact mathematical/adversarial source review PASS. Saved analysis15.563837s/RSS217676KiB. Independent readerdac81df4 passes every actual-delta row/count/rank and every local native margin in14.346828s; three separate Rust complete-file seal checks pass. Reader/source reviews are distinct from actual execution. Native local score arithmetic executes; encoder/model recurrence, backward, optimizer, finite candidate export and AR/full512 qualification are NOT_RUN.\n\nPrivate complete sourced runtime/results/audit/checks/reviews HFdbbd2cd718cc13b4700708070dff2c8fd5d1811e freshly verified; sealed result8,850,245B/six files, compressed saved-evidence1,633,666B. Existing cumulative558870s projection retained with no new increment, two podCPUthreads/1GiBprocessRAM/16MiBreport; no localCargo/model/largedownload. Currentmain concurrent terminal-weight evidence is preserved. Final812023152f2803dff85b8f70494b4193ff617999 exact-head source/evidence review PASS; actual four tests, scoped format/release CUDA build PASS at job20261008T185411Z, exit0/CHECKS_PASS. Build-only7a9065425875bb64f41bb4d71a8b306cb609318a9002500511d2ba9a22ffb831 is distinct from measured e065 binary; no repeated numerical run.\n\nNext after actual protected merge: one saved margin3610 check, without rerank/new gradient/encoder; a full coherent native finite candidate only if that question supplies the needed task-carrier evidence. No serving special cases/cursor/Source filter. Previous8/512 remains scoped. No geometric advantage or useful-model claim. Queue compatibility acknowledgements are not tests.\n\nReferences #820\n",
